  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refunds regarding the JPO-programme.                                   JPO program (Junior Professional Officers) are an important part of  the total Swedish focus on increased Swedish participation in         international organizations. The program offers young graduates the   opportunity to serve in the UN and other international organizations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xc5;terbetalningar g&#xe4;llande JPO-programmet.                               JPO-programmet (Junior Professional Officers) &#xe4;r en viktig del av    den samlade svenska satsningen p&#xe5; &#xf6;kad svensk n&#xe4;rvaro vid             internationella organisationer. Programmet ger yngre akademiker       m&#xf6;jlighet att tj&#xe4;nstg&#xf6;ra inom FN och andra internationella            organisationer.</narrative>
  </description>
